sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Wizard in browser
  participant P as Composite progress route
  participant C as Composite route
  participant D as D-ID result URL
  participant F as ffmpeg child process
  W->>P: open event stream for video id
  W->>C: POST presenterUrl layout audioMode captions
  C->>D: download talking head MP4
  D-->>C: presenter clip saved to tmp dir
  C->>C: read SRT and write caption text files
  C->>F: spawn with filter_complex and progress pipe
  F-->>C: Duration line then out_time lines on stderr
  C->>P: write percent into progress store Map
  P-->>W: data event with pct and eta every 1.5s
  F-->>C: progress=end and exit code 0
  C-->>W: compositedUrl for the final MP4
  W->>W: swap player to composited video
